{
  "name": "CreateEnvironmentVariable",
  "summary": "新建变量",
  "tags": "共享版-环境变量管理",
  "productshort": "APIG",
  "region_id": "ae-ad-1",
  "paths": {
    "/apigw/env-variables": {
      "post": {
        "summary": "新建变量",
        "x-support-sdk": "N",
        "x-is-registered": "Y",
        "description": "将API发布到不同的环境后,对于不同的环境,可能会有不同的环境变量,比如,API的服务部署地址,请求的版本号等。\n\n用户可以定义不同的环境变量,用户在定义API时,在API的定义中使用这些变量,当调用API时,API网关会将这些变量替换成真实的变量值,以达到不同环境的区分效果。\n\n环境变量定义在API分组上,该分组下的所有API都可以使用这些变量。\n> 1.环境变量的变量名称必须保持唯一,即一个分组在同一个环境上不能有两个同名的变量\n\n  2.环境变量区分大小写,即变量ABC与变量abc是两个不同的变量\n\n  3.设置了环境变量后,使用到该变量的API的调试功能将不可使用。\n\n  4.定义了环境变量后,使用到环境变量的地方应该以对称的#标识环境变量,当API发布到相应的环境后,会对环境变量的值进行替换,如:定义的API的URL为:https://#address#:8080,环境变量address在RELEASE环境上的值为:192.168.1.5,则API发布到RELEASE环境后的真实的URL为:https://192.168.1.5:8080。",
        "schemes": [
          "https"
        ],
        "tags": [
          "共享版-环境变量管理"
        ],
        "operationId": "CreateEnvironmentVariable",
        "responses": {
          "201": {
            "schema": {
              "$ref": "#/definitions/EnvVariableResp"
            },
            "examples": {
              "application/json": {
                "variable_value": "192.168.1.5",
                "env_id": "cca3616a-f368-4b32-9064-b2a631cb3eeb",
                "group_id": "73c58022-f20d-495a-a188-85d718647f09",
                "id": "104185e5-3e8f-4c63-a7e5-ef4117bf870c",
                "variable_name": "address"
              }
            },
            "description": "Created"
          },
          "400": {
            "description": "Bad Request"
          },
          "401": {
            "description": "Unauthorized"
          },
          "403": {
            "description": "Forbidden"
          },
          "404": {
            "description": "Not Found"
          },
          "500": {
            "description": "Internal Server Error"
          }
        },
        "parameters": [
          {
            "in": "header",
            "name": "X-Auth-Token",
            "x-example": "MIIDkgYJKoZIhvcNAQcCoIIDgzCCXXXXXX...",
            "description": "用户Token。通过调用IAM服务获取用户Token接口获取(响应消息头中X-Subject-Token的值)。",
            "type": "string",
            "required": true
          },
          {
            "schema": {
              "$ref": "#/definitions/EnvVariableReq"
            },
            "in": "body",
            "name": "CreateEnvironmentVariableRequestBody",
            "description": "创建环境变量的请求体",
            "required": true
          }
        ]
      }
    }
  },
  "definitions": {
    "EnvVariableReq": {
      "required": [
        "env_id",
        "group_id",
        "variable_name",
        "variable_value"
      ],
      "properties": {
        "variable_value": {
          "description": "变量值支持英文字母、数字、英文格式的下划线、中划线,斜线(/)、点、冒号,1 ~ 255个字符。",
          "type": "string",
          "example": "192.168.1.5"
        },
        "env_id": {
          "description": "环境编号",
          "type": "string",
          "example": "cca3616a-f368-4b32-9064-b2a631cb3eeb"
        },
        "group_id": {
          "description": "API分组编号",
          "type": "string",
          "example": "73c58022-f20d-495a-a188-85d718647f09"
        },
        "variable_name": {
          "description": "变量名,支持英文字母、数字、英文格式的下划线、中划线,必须以英文字母开头, 3 ~ 32个字符。在API定义中等于#Name的值#部分(区分大小写),发布到环境里的API被变量值换。\n> 中文字符必须为UTF-8或者unicode编码。",
          "type": "string",
          "example": "address"
        }
      }
    },
    "EnvVariableResp": {
      "properties": {
        "variable_value": {
          "description": "变量值",
          "type": "string"
        },
        "env_id": {
          "description": "环境编号",
          "type": "string"
        },
        "group_id": {
          "description": "API分组编号",
          "type": "string"
        },
        "id": {
          "description": "环境变量编号",
          "type": "string"
        },
        "variable_name": {
          "description": "变量名",
          "type": "string"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  "version": "2.0",
  "parameters": {},
  "host": "apig.ae-ad-1.myhuaweicloud.com",
  "base_path": "/v1.0",
  "info_version": "v1",
  "method": "post",
  "uri": null
}